  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 304.05 Limitations on Permit Issuance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 304.05 Limitations on Permit Issuance.\n\n(a) A permit for a significant hazard or high hazard non-permitted dam built on or after July 25, 2000 shall be issued only if the dam meets the criteria established in RSA 482:9, V.\n\n(b) A permit for a dam on a great pond shall be issued only in accordance with RSA 482:6.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-0; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
}
